    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1396">

                <pb facs="1100" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg984"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 412.11/145.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-12-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 11, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Embassy has succeeded in obtaining payment through informal action of two of
                    the claims of the class referred to in the last paragraph of my telegram of
                    December 6.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schuyler.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
